# held/props/oud: the oud for the Lute posture (PROPS, P2b): a deep round-backed body with a brass rose and a sharply bent-back pegbox. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. The strumming
# right hand (hold, low) over the body, the neck to the left hand (pose arms: reach); anchored on the right shoulder,
# under the hands; from behind only the neck's head shows past the shoulder.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held oud
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

view D key hold origin 1 -1 layer neck
